===============================================================================
LICENSE BOUNDARY — assets/ccbysa/**
===============================================================================

This MIT license covers all ORIGINAL Typemon code and assets in this
repository, with one carve-out:

  assets/ccbysa/**  is NOT MIT-licensed.

The assets/ccbysa/** directory is a separate, third-party asset island. It is
distributed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0). Its full license text is at assets/ccbysa/LICENSE and its
per-file attribution ledger is at assets/ccbysa/ATTRIBUTION.md.

  - Source:  OpMonTeam/OpMon-Data — https://github.com/OpMonTeam/OpMon-Data
  - Author:  OpMon Team contributors
  - License: CC BY-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Two consequences of that boundary:

  1. Any adaptation, remix, or redistribution of material under
     assets/ccbysa/** MUST remain under CC BY-SA 4.0 (share-alike), and MUST
     retain the attribution in assets/ccbysa/ATTRIBUTION.md.

  2. Original Typemon code and assets never depend on the assets/ccbysa/**
     namespace: the build asserts that no original/paid monster definition
     references that island. The MIT layer therefore stands alone as MIT.

One in-island exception: assets/ccbysa/audio/8bit-battle.ogg is CC0-1.0
(public-domain dedication, credit Ted Kerr / Wolfgang_), not CC BY-SA. See the
audio ledger at the end of assets/ccbysa/ATTRIBUTION.md.
